      "verseKey": "64:1",
      "surahNumber": 64,
      "ayahNumber": 1,
      "text": "يُسبّح لله . . : يُنـزّهه و يُمَجّده تعالى و يدلّ عليه\\nله المُلك : التـّصرف المطلق في كلّ شيء",
      "kind": "meaning",
      "source": "Quran-Database - Arabic Meanings",
      "sourceId": "quran-database-arabic-meanings",
      "language": "ar",
      "direction": "rtl"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "64:3",
      "surahNumber": 64,
      "ayahNumber": 3,
      "text": "بالحقّ : بالحِـكمة البالغة\\nفأحسن صُوَركم : أتقـَنـَـها و أحكمها",
      "kind": "meaning",
      "source": "Quran-Database - Arabic Meanings",
      "sourceId": "quran-database-arabic-meanings",
      "language": "ar",
      "direction": "rtl"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "64:5",
      "surahNumber": 64,
      "ayahNumber": 5,
      "text": "وَبال أمرهم : سوء عاقبة كفرهم في الدنيا",
      "kind": "meaning",
      "source": "Quran-Database - Arabic Meanings",
      "sourceId": "quran-database-arabic-meanings",
      "language": "ar",
      "direction": "rtl"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "64:6",
      "surahNumber": 64,
      "ayahNumber": 6,
      "text": "تـَـولّوْا : أعرضوا عن الإيمان بالرسل",
      "kind": "meaning",
      "source": "Quran-Database - Arabic Meanings",
      "sourceId": "quran-database-arabic-meanings",
      "language": "ar",
      "direction": "rtl"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "64:8",
      "surahNumber": 64,
      "ayahNumber": 8,
      "text": "النور : القرآن",
      "kind": "meaning",
      "source": "Quran-Database - Arabic Meanings",
      "sourceId": "quran-database-arabic-meanings",
      "language": "ar",
      "direction": "rtl"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "64:9",
      "surahNumber": 64,
      "ayahNumber": 9,
      "text": "ليَوْم الجمع : في يوم القيامة حيث تجتمع الخلائق للحساب و الجَزاء\\nيوم التغابن : يَظهر فيه غَـبْن الكافر بتـَركِه الإيمان و غبن المؤمن بتقصيره في الإحسان",
      "kind": "meaning",
      "source": "Quran-Database - Arabic Meanings",
      "sourceId": "quran-database-arabic-meanings",
      "language": "ar",
      "direction": "rtl"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "64:11",
      "surahNumber": 64,
      "ayahNumber": 11,
      "text": "بإذن الله : بإرادته و قضائه و قـَـدَره تعالى\\nيَهْدِ قـَـلبَه : يوفّـقه لليَقين و الصّـبر و التـّـسليم",
      "kind": "meaning",
      "source": "Quran-Database - Arabic Meanings",
      "sourceId": "quran-database-arabic-meanings",
      "language": "ar",
      "direction": "rtl"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "64:15",
      "surahNumber": 64,
      "ayahNumber": 15,
      "text": "فِـتنـَـة ٌ : بلاءٌ و مِحنة و اختبار",
      "kind": "meaning",
      "source": "Quran-Database - Arabic Meanings",
      "sourceId": "quran-database-arabic-meanings",
      "language": "ar",
      "direction": "rtl"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "64:16",
      "surahNumber": 64,
      "ayahNumber": 16,
      "text": "يُوق شُحّ نفسِه : يُـكْفَ بُخلَـهَا الشديد مع حِرْصها",
      "kind": "meaning",
      "source": "Quran-Database - Arabic Meanings",
      "sourceId": "quran-database-arabic-meanings",
      "language": "ar",
      "direction": "rtl"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "64:17",
      "surahNumber": 64,
      "ayahNumber": 17,
      "text": "قـَـرْضًا حَسَنا : احتسابا بطيبة نفس و إخلاص",
